WEBVTT

00:05:27.165 --> 00:05:30.123
broad strokes, don't worry about staying in the lines.

00:05:30.123 --> 00:05:31.399
All right. Great.

00:05:31.399 --> 00:05:32.975
And why don't you take that marker and recap it

00:05:32.975 --> 00:05:34.905
and place it on the table for me.

00:05:34.905 --> 00:05:38.125
Okay, and pick up another marker out of the cup

00:05:38.125 --> 00:05:40.575
and take off the cap

00:05:40.575 --> 00:05:42.641
and color in the donkey for me, color in the donkey.

00:05:42.641 --> 00:05:45.709
Big scribbles.

00:05:45.709 --> 00:05:47.943
Okay, cool, and re-cap that marker

00:05:47.943 --> 00:05:49.445
and place it on the table.

00:05:49.445 --> 00:05:51.723
And pick up another marker for me

00:05:51.723 --> 00:05:54.186
and take off the cap. Isn't this fun?

00:05:54.186 --> 00:05:55.513
And color in the owl for me.

00:05:55.513 --> 00:05:58.564
Color in the owl.

00:05:58.564 --> 00:06:01.050
Okay, and recap that marker